# internOS workspace-level .gitignore
#
# Lives at the workspace root (e.g. `~/workspaces/<org>/.gitignore`).
# The workspace repo tracks org-scoped internOS state ONLY — projects each have
# their own repo (see templates/git/project.gitignore), and code repos live
# inside projects. Allowlist style: ignore everything, then re-include the
# internOS file shapes this repo is allowed to track.
#
# Update when the framework adds a new workspace-level file shape.

# Ignore everything at the workspace root by default.
/*

# Re-include the internOS state this repo owns.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/docs/
!/projects/

# Inside projects/, only the workspace-level registry is tracked here. Each
# individual project directory is its own repo and must remain opaque to this
# one — never commit a project's internOS files from the workspace repo.
projects/*
!projects/REGISTRY.md
